# T-Deck: everything by touch. The shortcut bar is the bottom 34 rows of
# 320x240; its buttons are 64 wide.
vim on
shot touch-home
tap 96 223
shot touch-contacts
tap 224 223
shot touch-channels
tap 32 223
# The second chat; drag up for older messages; the header arrow is back.
tap 100 80
shot touch-chat
swipe 160 170 160 60 400
shot touch-chat-dragged
tap 10 8
# Hold a row for its details.
long 100 50
shot touch-details
tap 10 8
# Swipe sideways on Home for the next tab.
swipe 250 120 80 125 200
shot touch-swiped
# The menu, dragged, and a row tapped.
tap 288 223
shot touch-menu
swipe 160 40 160 180 400
shot touch-menu-dragged
tap 160 120
shot touch-menu-tapped
long 10 8
shot touch-home-again
